<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Landing Page Keren Anda</title>
    <style>
        /* Gaya Dasar / Reset */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            color: #333;
            line-height: 1.6;
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
        }

        /* Navigasi */
        nav {
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 20px 10%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        nav .logo {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #2563eb;
        }

        nav ul {
            display: flex;
            list-style: none;
        }

        nav ul li {
            margin-left: 20px;
        }

        nav ul li a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #555;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        nav ul li a:hover {
            color: #2563eb;
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #eff6ff 0%, #dbeafe 100%);
            padding: 100px 10%;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 48px;
            color: #1e3a8a;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 20px;
            color: #4b5563;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto 30px auto;
        }

        .cta-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #2563eb;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 15px 30px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.2);
            transition: background 0.3s, transform 0.2s;
        }

        .cta-btn:hover {
            background: #1d4ed8;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        /* Fitur / Layanan */
        .features {
            padding: 80px 10%;
            background: #fff;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .features h2 {
            font-size: 32px;
            color: #1e3a8a;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .card {
            background: #f8fafc;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            transition: transform 0.3s;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        .card h3 {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            color: #1e293b;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            background: #1e293b;
            color: #94a3b8;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px 10%;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        /* Responsif untuk HP */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero h1 { font-size: 32px; }
            .hero p { font-size: 16px; }
            nav { flex-direction: column; gap: 15px; text-align: center; }
            nav ul li { margin: 0 10px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Navigasi -->
    <nav>
        <div class="logo">SitusKu</div>
        <ul>
            <li><a href="#">Beranda</a></li>
            <li><a href="#fitur">Fitur</a></li>
            <li><a href="#kontak">Kontak</a></li>
        </ul>
    </nav>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero">
        <h1>Solusi Digital untuk Bisnis Anda</h1>
        <p>Buat website landing page profesional dengan cepat, mudah, dan aman tanpa biaya hosting bulanan.</p>
        <a href="https://wa.me" class="cta-btn" target="_blank">Hubungi Kami</a>
    </section>

    <!-- Fitur Section -->
    <section class="features" id="fitur">
        <h2>Mengapa Memilih Kami?</h2>
        <div class="grid">
            <div class="card">
                <h3>⚡ Super Cepat</h3>
                <p>Website dioptimalkan dengan CDN global Cloudflare sehingga loading sangat instan.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>🔒 Sangat Aman</h3>
                <p>Mendapatkan proteksi HTTPS/SSL gratis bawaan untuk keamanan data pengunjung.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>📱 Responsif</h3>
                <p>Tampilan otomatis menyesuaikan rapi saat dibuka di HP, tablet, maupun komputer.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer id="kontak">
        <p>&copy; 2026 SitusKu. Dibuat gratis menggunakan GitHub & Cloudflare Pages.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
